  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for HabitPulse', 'description': 'Primary container for HabitPulse implementation: HabitTrack is a personal Android application designed to help users build and maintain daily habits. Users can add custom habits, mark them as completed each day, and monitor their progress through a calendar or streak tracker interface. The app aims to provide a simple and motivating way to develop positive routines.', 'interfaces': [], 'framework': 'android', 'platform': 'mobile', 'container': '{\n  "name": "HabitPulse-35202 frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Add Habit",\n      "description": "Allows users to create and customize new habits they want to track.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Daily Completion",\n      "description": "Users can mark each habit as completed for the day.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Progress Calendar",\n      "description": "Displays a calendar view showing which days habits were completed.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Streak Tracker",\n      "description": "Tracks consecutive days a habit has been completed to motivate consistency.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "Android"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#4CAF50",\n    "secondary": "#FFFFFF",\n    "accent": "#FFC107"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The main screen displays a list of user habits with checkboxes for daily completion. A bottom navigation bar provides access to the calendar view and streak tracker. The calendar view highlights completed days, while the streak tracker shows current and longest streaks for each habit. The UI is clean, minimal, and easy to navigate."\n}'}",
